eceived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kunobi-ninja/kache/issues/810","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Parent: #810\n\nDeliver a bounded trusted node-local L1 cache for ephemeral self-hosted CI jobs, with explicit ownership and no public/fork exposure.\n\n## Required behavior\n\n- Define one supported per-node store/daemon lifecycle across one-job ARC runner pods.\n- Preserve Kache's local SQLite/blob correctness under concurrent trusted jobs.\n- Isolate trust domains so public, fork, or otherwise untrusted jobs cannot read or mutate the trusted cache.\n- Bound disk with GC, reservations, health, and node-local hit/miss/byte metrics.\n- Fail open to ordinary per-job L2/v3 behavior when L1 is unavailable.\n- Document runner/platform wiring and operational rollback.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- Warm trusted nodes download only misses.\n- Isolation tests prove untrusted jobs receive no node-cache mount/socket/credentials.\n- Concurrent-job, daemon restart, corrupt local entry, disk-pressure, and fallback tests.\n- Five clean cold-node and warm-node representative runs.\n","closed_by":{"login":"jleni","id":13698520,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjk4NTIw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13698520?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni","html_url":"https://github.com/jleni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jleni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht